{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Vanguard Protocol<strong> \u2013 The Fast-Paced, Brutal, No-Nonsense FPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vanguard Protocol</strong> is a first-person shooter built for adrenaline junkies. Dive into ultra-fast battles, wield a devastating arsenal, and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Pure Action, Precise Shooting:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense, no-frills gameplay:</strong> Reflexes, accuracy, speed. There's no room for mistakes here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse arsenal:</strong> Pistols, assault rifles, snipers, explosives \u2013 each weapon has its own feel and strategic edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic maps:</strong> Arenas designed for movement, tactical angles, and close-quarters combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic game modes:</strong> Deathmatch, Team Elimination, Domination \u2013 solo or online against other players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758990/extras/9fe06c7d8fc1e5996f670365c70f1097.avif?t=1760556406\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758990/extras_big/9fe06c7d8fc1e5996f670365c70f1097.avif?t=1760556406 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>No Gimmicks. Just Shooting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vanguard Protocol</strong> cuts straight to the chase: put a weapon in your hands and throw you into high-octane battles where only the best survive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758990?t=1760556406","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758990?t=1760556406","capsule_im